# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# Local / editor-only (kept on disk, not committed)
.cursor/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.next-docs/

# testing
/coverage

